{
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-12.txt/0": "什么？！住手，你误会了！\r\n别挥剑！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-13.txt/0": "嗯？你们不是为魔王效力？",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-14.txt/0": "\\c[51]Aerdou\\c[0]！你也一样！\r\n把枪放下！我们正在讨伐魔王，\r\n不是敌人！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-15.txt/0": "嗯，是这样吗……不过，\r\n可恶，我身上黏糊糊的！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-16.txt/0": "啊哈哈……你知道\r\n有关魔王的事情吗？",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-17.txt/0": "我知不知道……？\r\n啊，对了，刚才我似乎\r\n从他的精神控制中清醒过来了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-18.txt/0": "咦？！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-19.txt/0": "不过，我已经不再受精神控制了……",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-20.txt/0": "一定是我的钢铁意志强大无比，\r\n才让我摆脱了精神控制。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-21.txt/0": "真、真的吗？那可真厉害！\r\n（真正的原因，该不会是被\\c[52]小瓶\\c[0]里的东西\r\n弄湿了吧？）",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-22.txt/0": "呃，在这种地方浪费时间可不行！\r\n我必须去寻找\\c[51]芙蕾达\\c[0]公主！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-23.txt/0": "\\c[51]加尔茨公爵\\c[0]离开了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-24.txt/0": "咦？你认识\\c[51]芙蕾达\\c[0]？\r\n啊，他已经走了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-25.txt/0": "不过，那个魔王竟能控制\r\n如此强大的人……\r\n我们最好做好心理准备。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-26.txt/0": "不过……错过与如此强者\r\n交手的机会，也许是个错误。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-28.txt/0": "\\c[51]Aerdou\\c[0]，你今天格外有骑士风范！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c21/cs012c21-29.txt/0": "别说了！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-01.txt/0": "啊！国王！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-02.txt/0": "哦，是你们？",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-03.txt/0": "哇！你这是要发表什么时尚宣言吗？！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-04.txt/0": "算、算了，就忘了吧。\r\n我相信你有充分理由，\r\n虽然我一点都不想知道……",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-05.txt/0": "不过，我离开城堡后才发现……\r\n这个世界和我那里并不相同……",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-06.txt/0": "看来这个世界中\r\n并不存在\\c[52]黑暗\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-07.txt/0": "国王……",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-08.txt/0": "不过，我感觉到了魔王的气息。\r\n他也来到了这个世界。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-09.txt/0": "那道光芒……会和魔王有关系吗？\r\n我也不知道……",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-10.txt/0": "不过，若有可能，\r\n我希望你们能拯救这个世界……",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-11.txt/0": "顺带见一见魔王也好。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c31/cs012c31-12.txt/0": "祝你们成功。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-01.txt/0": "愚蠢的家伙……这个世界也有勇者？\r\n嗯……真是有意思。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-02.txt/0": "愚蠢的家伙……你就凭这副模样\r\n来向我挑战，是在开玩笑吗？",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-03.txt/0": "抱歉。\r\n我这么做是有理由的。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-04.txt/0": "呃……真是的……\r\n既然如此……我们也没办法了……",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-06.txt/0": "你、你就是\\c[51]维克托国王\\c[0]\r\n所说的魔王？",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-07.txt/0": "哦？看来……\r\n那家伙也一路来到了这里……",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-08.txt/0": "这个世界和那个世界很像……\r\n都完全看不到希望。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-09.txt/0": "留在这里和你们这些弱者闲聊也许有趣，\r\n但那场“灾厄”可不会等我。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-10.txt/0": "只要打倒我，\\c[52]黑暗\\c[0]就会停止……\r\n也许，打倒我也能阻止那道光芒？",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-11.txt/0": "可是！这……根本没有证据！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-12.txt/0": "没错，没有证据，不过……\r\n首先你根本没有击败我的能力。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-13.txt/0": "所以阻止它本来就是\r\n不可能实现的妄想。",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-14.txt/0": "你确定吗？！",
  "message/data/event/mes/class/cs012c41/cs012c41-15.txt/0": "哼，既然你不过来，\r\n那我就亲自去找你！勇者！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c01-01.txt/0": "嘿嘿！老板，让我加入队伍吧！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c01-02.txt/0": "队伍里已经有三名成员了。\r\nKoppa无法加入。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c02-01.txt/0": "我珍藏的草药！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c02-02.txt/0": "嘿嘿！\r\n你还真是难伺候！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c02-03.txt/0": "这是……\r\n最后一株草药了！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c02-04.txt/0": "草药用完了……\r\n祝你好运！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c03-01.txt/0": "哇！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c03-02.txt/0": "呃！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c03-03.txt/0": "痛痛痛痛……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c04-01.txt/0": "好痛，哎哟……\r\n今天就到此为止吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01001/dl01001c05-01.txt/0": "呼……呼……\r\n今天就到此为止吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-01.txt/0": "哦……\r\n勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！\r\n你好！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-02.txt/0": "哦……\r\n流浪勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！\r\n你好！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-03.txt/0": "没错！最近我发现了一件奇怪的东西。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-04.txt/0": "它很漂亮，我也很喜欢，不过……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-05.txt/0": "如果它能帮助你完成任务，\r\n我不介意卖给你！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-06.txt/0": "看这块奇怪石头的形状，\r\n它原本也许是某件饰品的一部分。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-07.txt/0": "而且它似乎蕴含着某种技能。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-08.txt/0": "你打算怎么做？购买这块石头吗？\r\n购买后可以使用\\c[51]打完就传送\\c[0]。\r\n[需要\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]]",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-09.txt/0": "知道了！\r\n祝你任务顺利！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-10.txt/0": "嗯……抱歉。\r\n看来你的钱不够！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-11.txt/0": "好，明白了！\r\n那么，拿去吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-12.txt/0": "从玛姆鲁那里拿到了石头。\r\n你感受到石头中的力量……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-13.txt/0": "现在可以使用\\c[51]打完就传送\\c[0]了！\r\n此技能只能在夜间使用。\r\n攻击后你会被传送。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c01-14.txt/0": "祝你任务顺利！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01002/dl01002c02-01.txt/0": "拿到了好东西！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01003/dl01003c01-01.txt/0": "<PLAYER>吃了大饭团！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01004/dl01004c01-01.txt/0": "风来人攻守均衡，\r\n擅长连击、暴击和使用盾牌。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01004/dl01004c01-02.txt/0": "也擅长发现地牢。\r\n或许天生就会被地牢吸引。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01004/dl01004c01-03.txt/0": "夜间技能只能在夜晚使用，\r\n不过其威力足以弥补这种不便。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01005/dl01005c01-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]与Koppa战斗\\c[0]技能！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01005/dl01005c02-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]打完就传送\\c[0]技能！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl01005/dl01005c03-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]震荡炮\\c[0]技能！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-01.txt/0": "哇啊啊？！\r\n你们是谁？",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-02.txt/0": "会、会说话的……兔子？\r\n呃，我是\\c[51]梅莫莉娅\\c[0]。\r\n这位是\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-03.txt/0": "啊，我听士兵说过！\r\n你就是勇者\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-04.txt/0": "我……？\r\n请叫我\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-05.txt/0": "对，我听说你和妖精\r\n正在踏上拯救世界的旅程……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-06.txt/0": "哇哦哦。\r\n真是太棒了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-07.txt/0": "要是有办法能帮上忙就好了……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-08.txt/0": "有了！\r\n我有个好主意！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-09.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，我可以和你们一起旅行，\r\n帮你们寻找有用的东西！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-10.txt/0": "嘿嘿！\r\n这主意不错吧？",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-11.txt/0": "怎么样，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]？\r\n愿意交给我约\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]吗？",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c01-12.txt/0": "我一定会找到有用的东西！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c02-01.txt/0": "呃，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]？",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c02-02.txt/0": "呵呵呵。\r\n看来你最终还是想依靠我？",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c03-01.txt/0": "交给\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]让她外出跑腿吗？\r\n几天后可以再次见到\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c04-01.txt/0": "真、真的……？\r\n这样吗？好吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c04-02.txt/0": "加油……\r\n我会支持你的。\r\n呜呜。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c05-01.txt/0": "很遗憾，你的钱不够。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c06-01.txt/0": "好！交给我们吧！\r\n我们一定会找到有用的东西！\r\n等着吧！！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c06-02.txt/0": "\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]拿走了\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]，\r\n跑出了城堡。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c06-03.txt/0": "这样真的没问题吗……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02001/dl02001c07-01.txt/0": "嘻嘻嘻嘻。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c01-01.txt/0": "你感觉\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]就在附近。\r\n也许跑腿很顺利？",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c03-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！妖精！\r\n好久不见，是我\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c03-02.txt/0": "这是一段很长……很长的旅程。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c03-03.txt/0": "我有好几次差点放弃，\r\n但都是因为\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]才坚持下来！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c03-04.txt/0": "那么……\r\n就不多说了！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c03-05.txt/0": "就是这个！",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-01.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]3\\c[0]个\\c[52]纳尤塔果\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-02.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]3\\c[0]个\\c[52]黑色纳尤塔果\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-03.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]魅力宝石\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-04.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]攻击宝石\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-05.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]鼓舞宝石\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-06.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]魅力宝石\\c[0]、\\c[52]攻击宝石\\c[0]和\r\n\\c[52]鼓舞宝石\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-07.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]绝望项链\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-08.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]绝望耳环\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-09.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]绝望指环\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-10.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]绝望十字架\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-11.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]绝望戒指\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-12.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]破旧衣服\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-13.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]附魔披风\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-14.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]生锈短剑\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-15.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]附魔匕首\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-16.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]魔杖\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c04-17.txt/0": "获得了\\c[52]简易木棒\\c[0]，\r\n来自\\c[51]Monomi\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c05-01.txt/0": "嘿嘿嘿。\r\n怎么样？\r\n有用吗？",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c06-01.txt/0": "呃……这个……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02002/dl02002c06-02.txt/0": "对不起。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02003/dl02003c01-01.txt/0": "超高校级学生并不擅长近身战斗。\r\n别让敌人靠近你。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02003/dl02003c01-02.txt/0": "特殊技能\\c[52]言弹（TB）\\c[0]\r\n可以远程攻击敌人。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02003/dl02003c01-03.txt/0": "在合适的时机使用\\c[52]言弹（TB）\\c[0]，\r\n是制胜策略的关键。",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02003/dl02003c01-04.txt/0": "随着旅程推进、力量变强，\r\n你会找到进一步强化\\c[52]言弹（TB）\\c[0]的方法……",
  "message/data/event/mes/dlc/dl02004/dl02004c01-01.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]TB：麻痹\\c[0]技能！",
